        <div class="col-panel" data-col-panel>
          <div class="col-label">
            <span class="col-label-text">Campaign与专项</span>
          </div>
          <div class="col-content">
            <h3 class="text-[20px] font-medium leading-[1.3] text-[var(--color-ink)] mb-[12px]">Campaign与专项</h3>
            <p class="text-[14px] font-normal leading-[1.6] text-[var(--color-stone)]">节日大促、新品上市、事件营销、跨平台联动。清晰的brief、明确的指标、节奏表、结束后的复盘，一样不少。</p>
